/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちやん、最近？\nブログで質問返ししないよね...\nもうしなくなっちゃったのー？\n(´｡･-･｡｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとだ(๑°︿°๑)\n無意識ですごめんなさい(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し楽しくて好きだよー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん↑ちゃんはカフェ好き⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー。カフェより\n吉野家とかすき家とかのが\n行くかな！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんのウエディングドレスが観たかったなぁ\n本番では何色のドレスが着てみたい？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"式では白で、\n披露宴では着物をリメイクして\n自分でドレス作りたいなあって♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ私結婚願望が......。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば前の街ブラの時の"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票結果はどうなったのかな？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-s46-53729":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":" ブログを開いて頂き、ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" えんどうりこです☺︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 先日、\n 新参者の千秋楽を迎え、三期生11人全員で走り抜けることができました〜！！\n Buddiesの皆さんの応援のおかげです☺︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 10公演あった新参者、あっという間に終わってしまいすごく寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 新参者期間、私は自分が思っている以上に三期生みんなのことが好きなんだなと自覚することが多かったなと感じています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 振りを揃えるためにみんなが動画を見て意見を言い合うところ。\n Overtureの時背中を叩き合って気合いを入れ合うところ。\n パフォーマンス中に顔を見合って笑い合うところ。\n ミスを責めずにカバーし合うところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 互いに高め合いながら前に進んでいく三期生の関係性がすごく大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" この新参者期間で三期生は本物の絆で結ばれました。だから三期生はこれからどんなことがあっても乗り越えていけると信じています。☺︎ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/9e3/e8179f3dee33c3f51abf425fe0e5f.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 🍰☺︎☺︎ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/9e3/e8179f3dee33c3f51abf425fe0e5f-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/9e3/e8179f3dee33c3f51abf425fe0e5f-02.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/9e3/e8179f3dee33c3f51abf425fe0e5f-03.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 三期生との関係性を大切にしながら、\n 櫻坂のメンバーとして、もっと成長していきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{